## 17. Champagne Tower

```python
poured = int(input("Poured Cups: "))
row = int(input("Query Row: "))
glass = int(input("Query Glass: "))

dp = [[0]*101 for _ in range(101)]
dp[0][0] = poured

for i in range(row + 1):
    for j in range(i + 1):
        extra = (dp[i][j] - 1) / 2
        if extra > 0:
            dp[i+1][j] += extra
            dp[i+1][j+1] += extra

print("Glass Fill =", min(1, dp[row][glass]))
```
